<tr>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="11%" colspan="2" rowspan="5">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2-bosqich</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #-ece9d8" valign="top" width="3%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="19%" colspan="2" rowspan="5">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.55pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklari</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #-ece9d8" valign="top" width="3%">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="39%" colspan="8" rowspan="5">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Autsorser talabgorlarini oʻrganish va eng yaxshi takliflarni tanlab olish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Gʻolib autsorserni aniqlash va bayonnomani rasmiylashtirish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Bayonnomadan koʻchirmani (autsorserlar tanlovi natijalarini) harbiy qism (muassasa) komandirlariga yuborish.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: #-ece9d8" valign="top" width="3%">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="21%" colspan="2" rowspan="5">
<p style="MARGIN: 0cm -6.85pt 0pt -2.75pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1, 2. Talabnoma qabul qilingandan soʻng 10 kun muddatda.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.25pt;LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.25pt;LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.25pt;LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 7.25pt;LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Bayonnoma tasdiqlangan kundan keyingi kundan kechiktirmay.</span></p></td></tr>
