<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%" colspan="2">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="10%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1-bosqich</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="16%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p style="MARGIN: 0cm -3.9pt 0pt -3.5pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Kengashi, viloyatlar va Toshkent shahar hokimliklari</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="43%" colspan="8" rowspan="2">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Oziq-ovqat mahsulotlari narxlarining bozordagi oʻrtacha koʻrsatkichlarini belgilash.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Oziq-ovqat mahsulotlari narxlarining bozordagi oʻrtacha koʻrsatkichlari haqida bayonnomani rasmiylashtirish.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.5pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Milliy gvardiya boʻlinmalariga oziq-ovqat mahsulotlari narxlarining bozordagi oʻrtacha koʻrsatkichlari haqida bayonnomani yetkazish.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="3%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1,2) Har oyda — joriy </span></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">oyning 1-sanasigacha.</span></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3) Bir kun mobaynida.</span></p></td></tr>
