<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"></p></td></tr>
<tr>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="10%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3-bosqich</span></b></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" width="16%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p style="MARGIN: 0cm -3.9pt 0pt 0cm" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oʻzbekisto� Respublikasi </span></p>
<p style="MARGIN: 0cm -3.9pt 0pt 0cm" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Milliy gvardiyasi boʻlinmalari</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="2%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="43%" colspan="8" rowspan="2">
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Autsorserlar bilan koʻrsatilgan xizmatlar uchun oʻzaro hisob-kitoblarni quyidagi tartibda amalga oshirish:</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">asoslovchi hujjatlarni tekshirish (hisob-fakturalar, bajarilgan ishlar dalolatnomalari), oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarining amaldagi narxlari toʻgʻrisidagi bayonnoma bilan belgilangan oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarining narxi oshirilgani toʻgʻrisidagi maʼlumotlarni taqqoslash;</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">autsorsing xizmatlari koʻrsatishning tegishli jadvalida koʻrsatib oʻtilgan oylik summaning 15 foizi miqdoridagi dastlabki toʻlovni autsorserning bank hisobraqamiga oʻtkazish;</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"></p>
<p style="TEXT-INDENT: 8.4pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">tuzilgan shartnoma shartlariga muvofiq qolgan 85 foiz miqdorida haqiqatda koʻrsatilgan xizmatlar summasidan kelib chiqib.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="3%">
<p style="LINE-HEIGHT: normal"></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt;BORDER-TOP: #-ece9d8;PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;BORDER-LEFT: #-ece9d8;PADDING-TOP: 0cm;BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid" valign="top" width="20%" colspan="2" rowspan="2">
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Bir kun mobaynida.</span></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Har oyda — joriy oyning</span></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">10-sanasigacha.</span></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"></p>
<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">10 bank ish kuni mobaynida.</span></p></td></tr>
